{
  "content": {
    "arguments": "$ARGUMENTS",
    "constraints": [
      {
        "id": "bfa6f3d4-9bbd-4c74-af21-822c2ff94360",
        "text": "Use the Bash tool. The Pebbles CLI at \"{PEBBLES_CLI}\" is the ONLY sanctioned way to change spec files — never edit .pebble files directly."
      },
      {
        "id": "22209154-d99e-42c2-9873-12dc3e0a2224",
        "text": "Bound by system rule: Spec mutation contract (rules/system/spec-mutation-contract)"
      },
      {
        "id": "0009f607-e577-41b9-a874-3b6ef9aa4b99",
        "text": "Bound by system rule: Status discipline (rules/system/status-discipline)"
      },
      {
        "id": "22a68917-bc66-4cca-95de-ee632e84ef78",
        "text": "Bound by system rule: Findings are the append-only evidence log (rules/system/findings-as-evidence)"
      },
      {
        "id": "b09895a4-fec5-4fd5-bf73-c756596cbf9a",
        "text": "Bound by system rule: Graph-first navigation (rules/system/graph-first-navigation)"
      },
      {
        "id": "d9bf58de-29ff-4e91-a0d6-cf73eb3a163b",
        "text": "Bound by system rule: Verification — standard (rules/system/verification-standard)"
      },
      {
        "id": "7a5ccf82-d248-48b7-967c-4e1f3675bc8b",
        "text": "Bound by system rule: Command discipline (rules/system/command-discipline)"
      }
    ],
    "examples": [],
    "kind": "skill",
    "onFailure": [
      {
        "id": "b70a9299-64d8-4177-bcb6-e0d74dfae1a1",
        "text": "Read the CLI error — it names the fix; correct the call and retry once"
      },
      {
        "id": "d920153d-9e78-44e4-bb3b-2e1cb16b1b50",
        "text": "NEVER fall back to editing .pebble files directly, whatever failed"
      },
      {
        "id": "5c25eefd-a10a-4a58-a64f-5eea0022b968",
        "text": "If still blocked, report the exact command and error to the user and stop"
      }
    ],
    "output": "A still-true / drifted / broken summary with counts; statuses corrected and findings filed for rot.",
    "prerequisites": [
      {
        "id": "3812384a-0017-466f-a0a0-90ac42dce383",
        "text": "A fresh map (map --fresh) — drift is judged against it"
      }
    ],
    "purpose": "Drift sweep: re-check every bound spec against reality",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "76aca5db-95e7-4b1d-add3-b0ccc016066a",
        "text": "Audit the spec graph for rot — statuses are promises, verify they still hold: $ARGUMENTS"
      },
      {
        "id": "864f4a45-4db9-41b6-923d-34728ff04537",
        "text": "PREFLIGHT: a FRESH map (\"{PEBBLES_CLI}\" map --fresh) — drift is judged against it."
      },
      {
        "id": "1cf3f4b8-baa2-4d7b-b5bc-0cd11d1bdf55",
        "text": "STEP 1 — SCOPE: `query --status verified` (then implemented) for the promises you will re-check; a scoped audit beats a vague sweep."
      },
      {
        "id": "afc3bef8-b496-4d60-9bc1-a1cb37c0d45f",
        "text": "STEP 2 — CHECK each bound pebble: its codeLinks still exist in the map AND the linked symbols still exist (map-file). File gone or symbol gone → the promise is broken."
      },
      {
        "id": "c74e18d6-3de9-451e-9b96-aa08319adc09",
        "text": "STEP 3 — RECORD truthfully: set drift/missing on what no longer holds, then \"{PEBBLES_CLI}\" add-finding --category regression --body \"## Observation\\n\\n...\\n\\n## Evidence\\n\\n- file:line — proof\" (supersede the prior finding when re-judging the same claim, never edit it). Spot-check behavior on the most-imported hubs."
      },
      {
        "id": "d3d7df40-389e-4598-bb34-845037cd0681",
        "text": "Report: still-true / drifted / broken with counts, and the findings filed."
      }
    ],
    "verify": [
      {
        "id": "1039d278-c213-4999-8fd3-f3b7cd36617b",
        "text": "Every implemented/verified pebble was checked — report counts: still-true / drifted / broken"
      },
      {
        "id": "ef8f8433-4cb2-4116-aae5-f44eb674f314",
        "text": "Open finding chain-tips were re-confirmed (superseding finding appended: resolved or still-open)"
      },
      {
        "id": "f994bcef-95fb-42dd-8582-8b089e618452",
        "text": "At least one finding records this audit's outcome"
      }
    ],
    "whenToUse": "Periodic drift sweep: re-verify every implemented/verified pebble's codeLinks and symbols against a fresh map."
  },
  "createdAt": "2026-07-21T14:32:38.763Z",
  "description": "Drift sweep: re-check every bound spec against reality",
  "id": "6660a86d-6ef9-42ae-966a-cd4d7a025235",
